OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews travel 30 miles for
OL,4,Avital equipment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house fire has renewed questions over
OL,7,Fwhy specialist firefighting equipment
OL,8,Fis based far from some communities
OL,9,Fdespite a series of major incidents
OL,10,Frequiring its use.
OL,12,FIn Dorset, crews tackling a fire at a
OL,13,Fhouse in Queen's Avenue, Dorchester,
OL,14,Fhad to wait for an aerial ladder to
OL,15,Ftravel about 30 miles (48km) from
OL,16,FWestbourne.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
