OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews travel 30 miles for
OL,4,Avital equipment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident is one of many in recent
OL,7,Fyears where high ladder units have been
OL,8,Fbrought in from Westbourne or Yeovil to
OL,9,Ftackle fires in Dorchester and
OL,10,FWeymouth, following the withdrawal of
OL,11,FWeymouth's own high ladder in 2018-19.
OL,13,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,14,FService said it believes its current
OL,15,Faerial ladder fleet supports "the level
OL,16,Fof risk and demand" across the area.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
